    hex "Color for USB endpoint active (0xRRGGBB)"
    default 0xFFFFFF

config RGBLED_WIDGET_CONN_RGB_SPLIT_CONNECTED
    hex "Color for the halves of a split connected to each other (0xRRGGBB)"
    default 0xFF00FF
    help
      A colour of its own, so that blue and cyan always mean the computer.
      Over Bluetooth with LAYER_PUSH the central shows it on itself and on
      the peripheral that came, at the same moment, once that one is ready
      to be synced with (a couple of seconds after the link, for its
      discovery); a peripheral shows none of its own. Without LAYER_PUSH
      the central shows it alone. A peripheral still looking for its
      central keeps CONN_RGB_DISCONNECTED and its reminders.

